<title>ITALY: Italy mutual funds post 4.96trln lira April inflow.</title>
<headline>Italy mutual funds post 4.96trln lira April inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 4.964 trillion lire in April, compared with a net inflow of 5.99 trillion lire in March, Assogestioni, the industry body said.</p>
</text>
